    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d7b7e91d8f92e260a37a05e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她从小居住的故乡跟我不同，\n习俗自然也不尽相同。\n那么情人节的定义或许也有差异。",
      "source_fingerprint": "37641373014f3b3d777ad04110d91f6b50f4f02a10b964d8795378d33523bff4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1076/storytimeline_501076107.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        7,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/7/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:566f5c62cfa1ef2bd86cefab",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "除了赠送真心巧克力外，\n互送人情巧克力也是属于这天的重要文化之一。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c59455a21ff5ba2d681eac291def19ec4c4d74ac534f8564effb11836553f81",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1076/storytimeline_501076107.json",
      "json_path": [
