      "uid": "zhcn:0e4529727dfb1405a9a77d33",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "即使没有恋爱情感，\n仍然能趁这天对平时关照自己的对象表达感谢，\n这可是一年一次的难得机会。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d4792290eb66de7ec2d17cf9c11e4fdc350db8eca04ed942fd3e1aabdabc7719",
